config ZLRS_MGMT
	bool "Management protocol (framing and dispatch on the management CDC)"
	select ZLRS_PROTO
	help
	  Framing and command dispatch for the management CDC while the device is in management mode
	  (entries: doc/08-firmware.md 2, command table: doc/10-security.md 9).
	  Pure C: commands only touch the device through backend callbacks, so the host tests
	  can run every one of them against a fake backend, see tests/host.

module = ZLRS_MGMT
module-str = zlrs_mgmt
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_config"
